# Agency lifecycle representation: Privacy decision

1 November 2026. **Local source and artifact review only. Accept the bounded eight-action scope and the stated privacy invariants as design requirements. The comparison and AAD tuples are conditional design candidates. Neither protected-content placement is selected. New envelope, comparison, key-reference lookup, rotation, disposition, tombstone and persisted restore contracts remain unselected and unsupported.** This document accepts no schema, DDL, migration, production interface, reader, writer, Privacy adoption or Agency task.

